              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi nyowe, omwiru waawe, ndi ahagati y'abantu baawe abu waatooraine, eihanga rihango munonga, eritarikubaasa kubarwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
