          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga yaamugira ati: Ahabw'eokushaba ekigambo ekyo, oteeshabire kuhangaara, nari obutungi, nari okushabira abazigu baawe kufa, kureka okeeshabira obwengye bw'okumanya ebihikire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.11",
