              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ku origyendera omu mihanda yangye, waayorobera ebyatairweho n'ebiragiro byangye, nk'oku sho Daudi yaabaire abigyenderamu, ndyayongyera aha myaka yaawe.",
