              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima omukazi nyina w'omwana ohuriire, ahabw'okusaasibwa omwana we, yaagira omugabe ati: Mukama wangye, omwana ohuriire mumuhe, otamwita na kakye. Kwonka omukazi ondiijo yaagira ati: Tarikwija kuba wangye nari owaawe; bamucwemu ebicweka bibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe nikwo kugira ati: Omwana ogwo ohuriire mutamwita na kakye, mumuhe omukazi ow'okubanza, ahabw'okuba niwe nyina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abaisraeli boona baahurira oku omugabe acwire orwo rubanja, baamutiina, ahabw'okuba bakareeba obwengye bwa Ruhanga bw'okucwa emanja z'oburyo buri omuriwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.3.28"
            ]
          }
        }
